    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1122050/extras/3a636b889e7ad27243458acf70bc765b.webp?t=1747196521\" /></div><br>Use Suika's powers of controlling &quot;density&quot; and &quot;sparseness&quot; to go up against all sorts of colorful enemies and gimmicks in this 2D combo based action game title.<br>Join the almighty Suika on her journey through the beautiful world of Gensokyo.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1122050/extras/534e640be5c7818437fcab876254fbdd.webp?t=1747196521\" /></div><br><br><strong>\u30fbCombo, shooting, and counter-attack action!</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1122050/extras/6746c1a9f1f233ec41850b2a39f3ad85.poster.avif?t=1747196521\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1122050/extras/6746c1a9f1f233ec41850b2a39f3ad85.webm?t=1747196521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1122050/extras/6746c1a9f1f233ec41850b2a39f3ad85.mp4?t=1747196521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>\u30fbTwo types of charge attack!</strong><br> Featuring density charges and sparseness charges, unleashing an attack while charging adds the respective properties of &quot;density&quot; and &quot;sparseness&quot; to the attack.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1122050/extras/26ed7174376527a74b0674f3f34e2ba6.webp?t=1747196521\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Power-based Action</h2><br><strong>\u30fbWarp Shots</strong><br>\u3000Suika uses her powers of &quot;density&quot; to move at supersonic speeds.<br>\u3000Sh